    "description": "20-day average of absolute daily return divided by volume (Amihud illiquidity proxy) computed on each instrument's own trading calendar. Higher values identify assets whose price moves occur on thin volume (less liquid / more fragile); in this 15-instrument cross-asset benchmark high illiquidity positively predicts forward 10-day cross-sectional returns (liquidity-risk premium)."
