"""miner_2 exploration batch 2: skewness / drawdown / macro-conditional families.
Universe: 15 tradable cross-asset instruments. IC = cross-sectional Spearman rank IC.
Admission gates: |IC|>=0.007 and |ICIR|>=0.084 @ h=10.
