  2 Families: variance ratio (trend vs reversion), rolling Sharpe (quality),
  3 trend R2 (trend consistency), gap-risk share (overnight vol), leverage effect,
  4 conditional betas on crypto/copper/USDJPY, volume-price correlation.
  5 Validation window: 2020-01-01 .. 2026-07-15 (warm-up). Horizon-10 admission gate:
