 ✅ Output:
amihud_20 | expr: rolling_mean(|pct_change(close)| / volume, 20) | dir: 1
   desc: 20-day average of absolute daily return divided by volume (Amihud illiquidity proxy) computed on each instrument's own trading calendar. Higher values identify 

beta_ew_60d | expr: rolling 60d beta of asset returns vs equal-weight cross-asset market return | dir: 1
   desc: High-beta assets' relative performance vs the EW basket over 60 days; IC was positive over the warm-up window.

downside_vol_ratio_20 | expr: - (downside semi-vol / total vol) over 20d | dir: 1
   desc: Ratio of downside semi-volatility to total volatility over 20 days, sign-flipped so higher = more symmetric/lower downside concentration.

eurusd_beta_cond_60x20 | expr: beta(asset_ret, EURUSD_ret, 60) * (EURUSD/EURUSD.shift(20) - 1.0) | dir: 1
   desc: Conditional FX-risk signal: asset beta to EURUSD changes times the 20-day EURUSD move. Positive when an asset moves with a strengthening/weakening EUR while EUR

max_ret_20d | expr: rolling 20-day maximum of daily returns | dir: 1
   desc: Extreme up-move intensity over 20 days; positive relation with forward 10d returns in the sample.

rel_mom_20d_skip5 | expr: per-asset 20d momentum (skip 5) minus cross-sectional median | dir: 1
   desc: Relative (cross-sectionally demeaned) 20-day trend, skipping the last 5 days to reduce short-term reversal.

mom_10d_skip5 | expr: close.shift(5) / close.shift(15) - 1.0 | dir: 1
   desc: 10-day price momentum with 5-day skip to avoid short-term reversal: return from 15 days ago to 5 days ago.

mom_120d_skip5 | expr: close.shift(5) / close.shift(125) - 1.0 | dir: 1
   desc: 120-day (6-month) price momentum with 5-day skip: return from 125 days ago to 5 days ago.

